  27:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/micro_memory_planner.h **** // buffers it wants to lay out, and then calls the getter functions for
  28:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/micro_memory_planner.h **** // information about the calculated layout. For example:
