  57:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h ****   // planned for will depend on the size of this scratch memory, so you should
  58:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h ****   // enlarge it if you see an error when calling AddBuffer(). The memory can be
  59:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h ****   // reused once you're done with the planner, as long as you copy the
  60:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h ****   // calculated offsets to another location. Each buffer requires about 36 bytes
  61:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h ****   // of scratch.
